{"game": "palworld", "language": "english", "appid": 1623730, "month": "2026-07", "window": 1, "start_date": 1782864000, "end_date": 1783468799, "month_true_total": 21073, "quota": 36, "returned": 36, "pulled_at": "2026-10-07 17:00:35 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "229893419", "author": {"steamid": "76561198045647419", "personaname": "DJP1983", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/jackbushrod/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 1, "playtime_forever": 22939, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1210, "last_played": 1789140201, "avatar": "fef49e7fa7e1997310d705b2a6158ff8dc1cdfeb"}, "language": "english", "review": "Great for summer gaming with my son. No longer do we have to decide between different games because this one has it all.", "timestamp_created": 1783468062, "timestamp_updated": 1783468062, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1705651175", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "229891858", "author": {"steamid": "76561199479701910", "personaname": "chrisburd76", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199479701910/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 1, "playtime_forever": 13668, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 7366, "last_played": 1788036827, "avatar": "fef49e7fa7e1997310d705b2a6158ff8dc1cdfeb"}, "language": "english", "review": "Fun game play, hopinng the story is going to get even better with the update that is coming.\r\n", "timestamp_created": 1783466530, "timestamp_updated": 1783466530, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1705651175", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "229890729", "author": {"steamid": "76561198062584983", "personaname": "GodsHaNd90", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/godshand90/", "num_games_owned": 34, "num_reviews": 3, "playtime_forever": 104593, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 55, "playtime_at_review": 103489, "last_played": 1790547477, "avatar": "3de1e9ac39838b4ab5b04d041dc055fdcf3b962a"}, "language": "english", "review": "Long and short review version for you!\nBeen playing for almost 2k hours. (Short Answer) - The game is amazingly fun, very high level of replayability and also revolutionary in many ways with little negatives to point out. \n\nThe Negative. My only issue is the game feels and moves slow. Not the progression, but the actual movement. Walking, running, flying all feels a little lethargic. Idk if this is to make the game feel a tad bit bigger then it actually is but let me just say the game is very large in regards to its world size. The movement feels almost like slow motion it's doesn't move with the same fluidity you'd expect from another 60fps survival game. \n\nThe Good-\n(Long Answer) - In my opinion Palworld Is Fantastic. It truly shines above all other types of games similar to it with its Online PVP gameplay. Many dynamics of the game aren't really realized until your in a full PVP setting. And with the variety of settings you can change the replayability is darn there infinite. For example each community server you play in is bound to have slightly different or very different settings. I can't even begin to explain to you the different experiences and flavors you can enjoy when playing on community servers. \n\nThe Raiding Of Bases, Destroying Other Players Bases And Pals Guarding/working there is a feeling on both ends I can not say I've never experienced in any game in all my 30+ years of hardcore gaming. This game in PVP is exceptional at invoking feelings I haven't felt in any game and only have felt in real life.  Real Triumph/Real Despair. \n\nCombat is balance and very dynamic you can lose a fight to someone who is 10 levels lower then you because they are better at combat. Dog-Like fights super high above the land in the sky. But it gets dark sometimes and the feeling of watching someone destroy your base and level hours of work and construction you put in feels some how more potent here then in other games I've played and I think it's because the game is designed to make you bond with your pals and progress more so then in other survival games. \n\nI truly can't wait to see whats in store for the future of this game.", "timestamp_created": 1783465374, "timestamp_updated": 1783465374, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1705651175", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "229890472", "author": {"steamid": "76561198697281460", "personaname": "yassinoplaysfn", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198697281460/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 2, "playtime_forever": 1098, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 651, "last_played": 1783617317, "avatar": "44ef216788ed39afc2d071c0b0c71b8c65318864"}, "language": "english", "review": "its one of the best games ever", "timestamp_created": 1783465139, "timestamp_updated": 1783465139, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1705651175", "hardware": {"system_ram": "11995", "os": "Windows 11", "cpu_name": "12th Gen Intel(R) Core(TM) i5-12450HX", "adapter_description": "NVI